  "details": "It would be nice to be able to use the phones microphone on toggle mode, as Push to talk makes it so the other people are near muted, and I cant even be in a discord call or get a phone call without my mic not working at all or vrchats audio not working( when a phonecall comes in.) As a staff member of a vrc group that uses discord on a basis I have to use another device because the mic wont work on vrc but it does on discord calls, and android permissions do allow for an inapp voice chat and also work with discord with both of them having mic permissions simultaniously, not one gets it or the other.",
